            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.20.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luka 20:28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Napho ndugu anasagala phamwenga na mmwenga wao afwe bila kuricha mwana mlume, mkpwaza mfwadzi asilólwe ni mutu wanjina kondze ya atu a nyumba hiyo. Yuya ndugu wa mfwadzi ni amlóle hiye gungu. Chisha amuhendere gosi arigokala anahenderwa ni mlumewe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwana wa mwandzo wa chilume ndiyevyalwa ni hinyo andaisabiwa kukala ni wa mfwadzi ili dzinare risiyalwe kpwenye tsi ya Iziraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "RUT.4.7+RUT.4.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ruthi 4:7–8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela napho hiye ndugu wa mfwadzi kamtaki hiye gungu, phahi, gungu hiye andaphiya kpwa angambi a mudzi na akaambe, ‘Nduguye mfwadzi mlume wangu anarema kuendeleza dzina ra nduguye hipha Iziraeli; kamendze kunitimizira wajibu kama mlamu.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Halafu angambi a mudzi andamuiha hiye mlume na abishe naye. Napho andaenderera kuamba, ‘Silonda kumlóla,’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hiye mchetu gungu andamlunga mbere za hinyo angambi a mudzi, amvule chirahu chimwenga na amtsitsire mahe usoni na aambe, ‘Hivi ndivyo ahenderwavyo mutu anayerema kuendeleza chivyazi cha nduguye.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na dzina ra nyumbaye ko Iziraeli rindakala, ‘Nyumba ya mutu yevulwa chirahu.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
