                "loc": "1SA.15.2+1SA.15.3+1SA.15.4+1SA.15.5+1SA.15.6+1SA.15.7+1SA.15.8+1SA.15.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Samueli 15:2–9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Tambukirani Aamaleki arivyokuhendani mriphokala charoni kula Misiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tambukirani vira arivyokushambuliyani hiko njirani mriphokala muanyonje na kuolaga hara osi ambao kala anadzikokota nyuma zenu mana kala akaremwa. Aamaleki taayamuogopha Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa hivyo wakati Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wenu, ndiphokuoyezani kula kpwa maadui genu gosi ndigokuzungulukani kpwenye tsi ambayo anakuphani muimiliki, mnalondwa kuolaga Aamaleki osi tsetsetse hata asitambukirwe tsona himu duniani. Msiyale kuhenda hivi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.19"
            ]
          }
        }
